    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7277" root="حد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُدَادٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدِيدٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُدَادُكَ أَنْ تَفْعَلَ كَذَا</span>,
(K, TA,) with damm, (TA,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدَادُكَ</span></b> , (so in
