<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُصَارَاكَ</span>, (K,) [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُصَارُكَ</span>,] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْتَهَى أَمْرِكَ</span>. (TA.)

